  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Add a graphic to the badges that has a 21+ option\n\nSo a third option to the current 2 of a general age verified and 18 plus verified. This will help attend to the difference of legality age in multiple countries.\n\nNo we do not need to go crazy and add a 30 plus badge for the hag max crowd.",
